            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content": "<h5><strong>Egg Lava Custard Mooncake</strong></h5><p>Ingredients:</p><p>Wheat Flour, White Bean Paste (contains Sugar, White Bean, Soyabean Oil, Water, Green Bean, Glutinous Rice Flour, Starch), Butter, Egg, Salted Egg Yolk, Humectant (E420), Coconut Milk (contains Coconut Milk, Stabilizer (E415, E412)), Cream (contains Milk, Thickener (E407)), Sugar, Custard Powder (contains Corn Starch, Flavorings, Color (E160a(i)), Flavor Enhancer (E637), Salt, Modified Starch), Trehalose, Isomaltulose, Icing Sugar (contains Sugar, Corn Starch), Condensed Milk (contains Milk, Sugar, Milk Powder, Emulsifier (E322)), Whole Milk Powder, Salt, Color (E160b), Preservative (E202), Maltodextrin, Thickener (E415), Konjac Flour</p><p>This product contains cereals containing gluten, milk, eggs, soyabeans, tree nuts and their products.</p><p>This factory also manufactures peanuts, fish, crustacea and their products.  <br/></p><h5><strong>Osmanthus Sparkling Tea</strong></h5><p>Ingredients: Cold Brewed Osmanthus Tea (93%), White Grape Juice From Concentrate, Acid: Citric Acid, Vitamin C, Carbon Dioxide.</p><p></p>",
