            "text_line_3": "The Duddell’s x Saicho Osmanthus Sparkling Tea Mooncake Gift Box is priced at HK$520 (early bird offer for HK$498 available up to 30th August, 23:59 HKT), presents a luxurious pairing of six Duddell’s Lava Custard Mooncakes with two 200ml bottles of Saicho Osmanthus Sparkling Tea.Saicho Osmanthus Sparkling Tea is debuting exclusively at Duddell’s during Mid-Autumn Festival celebrations until the end of October.Scented with osmanthus blossoms, this Tie Guan Yin oolong from Xianyou County, China, has notes of apricot, cucumber and custard apples.Pairs well with summer salads, light seafood dishes and soft cheeses.Store in a cool, dry place. Once opened, keep refrigerated and consumed within five days.Sediment may naturally develop over time.Tasting notes: Apricot, mountain cucumber, custard apple.Mooncake Pairing Gift Box offer cannot be used in conjunction with other promotions or offers such as, but not limited to, welcome offers, sign up offers, etc.",
